From d1254968797380ac91329ca0e57fed32ff6c70b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 22:03:43 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed library browsing in the player side panel

The Video and Music buttons of the side panel rail now browse the library inside the panel instead of leaving the player: Video lists the folders holding videos and then their videos, Music lists Songs, Albums, Artists and Genres and then their tracks. The panel shows a back button, a breadcrumb and the item count as in the design, picking a video or a song plays it, and the Play Queue button returns to the queue.
---
 modules/gui/qt/Makefile.am                    |   1 +
 modules/gui/qt/meson.build                    |   1 +
 modules/gui/qt/player/qml/Player.qml          |  19 ++
 .../gui/qt/player/qml/SidePanelLibrary.qml    | 286 ++++++++++++++++++
 modules/gui/qt/player/qml/SidePanelRail.qml   |  18 +-
 5 files changed, 319 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 modules/gui/qt/player/qml/SidePanelLibrary.qml

